  "scope": "Actual stdGaussian E on finite-dimensional real Hilbert/Borel E, signed globally C2 f with real fL2/gradientL2/Phi(f²)L1 domains. These are produced by actual32 for its true sqrt-density. No cutoff limit/desired inequality/domain-of-repaired-density/law/energy certificate premises. Genuine noncompact function-LSI coefficient2 through internally derived actual cutoff limits; rank0/zero mass retained. Coherent33 KL/Fisher, full weak W12 extension, separate GaussianT2/FIRST4.6/both paper main/error/cost/composition/fullreader remain OPEN.",
